<title>FRANCE: EU cuts malt export refund to 15.00 Ecus.</title>
<headline>EU cuts malt export refund to 15.00 Ecus.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday cut the daily refund applying to malt exports to 15.00 Ecus per tonne from a previous level of 37.86 Ecus per tonne, French cereals office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The move, accompanied by an equally sharp reduction in the flour export refund, is designed to discourage processed product exports over Christmas and New Year.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
